scn 1
# Corner lanes (2026-11-06, protocol 313; tools/legion_corner_test.py): 40 2x2 bodies walk south down
# an 8-cell corridor, turn east into a second one and come out on open ground. Before corner lanes
# every body cut the inner corner and the second corridor carried about two files; the column now
# wheels, each file keeping its lane counted from the inner wall. Asset-free.
name corridor-corner-40
ticks 4000
players 1
map flat 128 128
wall 0 44 60 84
wall 68 0 32 64
wall 68 72 32 56
type sw mover 2 2500 10 1.8
group a 0 sw 40 rect 30 8 60 44
at 5 move a 116 68
gate leg1 60 56 68 56
gate leg2 88 64 88 72
probe lanes
